       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SEARCH-TABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DEPARTMENT-TABLE.
          05 DEPARTMENT OCCURS 4 TIMES
             INDEXED BY DEPARTMENT-INDEX.
             10 DEPARTMENT-CODE PIC X(3).
             10 DEPARTMENT-NAME PIC X(15).
       01 SEARCH-CODE PIC X(3) VALUE "IT".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "HR " TO DEPARTMENT-CODE(1).
           MOVE "HUMAN RESOURCES" TO DEPARTMENT-NAME(1).
           MOVE "FIN" TO DEPARTMENT-CODE(2).
           MOVE "FINANCE" TO DEPARTMENT-NAME(2).
           MOVE "IT " TO DEPARTMENT-CODE(3).
           MOVE "TECH SUPPORT" TO DEPARTMENT-NAME(3).
           MOVE "OPS" TO DEPARTMENT-CODE(4).
           MOVE "OPERATIONS" TO DEPARTMENT-NAME(4).
           SET DEPARTMENT-INDEX TO 1.
           SEARCH DEPARTMENT
               AT END DISPLAY "DEPARTMENT NOT FOUND"
               WHEN DEPARTMENT-CODE(DEPARTMENT-INDEX) = SEARCH-CODE
                   DISPLAY "DEPARTMENT: "
                           DEPARTMENT-NAME(DEPARTMENT-INDEX)
           END-SEARCH.
           STOP RUN.
